to-be-incorporated-into-paper-lines-74 : List (List Word)
to-be-incorporated-into-paper-lines-74 = cons "- **Agency is not an ordered spectrum** of how many options there are. It is access to the right" (cons "  action. Will is the path of sense and impulse acting in continuity (not distinct at the level of" (cons "  process); inhibition is a subsequent impulse at a subsequent point of the trajectory. There is no" (cons "  observe/decide/act loop; to the extent there is one, it is a scale-free process through body, mind" (cons "  and world." nil))))
